Once I had a character with an AC of -80, without any armor on !..
All it takes is to find a temple priest/priestess and a certain pet.
I did this only once, just to see how low AC could get. It seems there
is no limit. So it is possible to have a character with an AC of some
ridiculous magnitude. Yes, NOTHING can touch you then. Even when 
surrounded by eight minotaurs, with no ring of conflict on.

But this takes all the fun right out of the game. You KNOW you are
going to win it; it is only a matter of time. I did not even bother
to finish the game in which I had this character with a super AC.
(However, an AC of -20/25 does not always guarantee a win; one may
need certain armors and rings.) I too was thinking of a way to offset
this feature. Maybe some spell-casting monsters should be able
to cancel pluses on the armor, or the protection given by temple
priests/priestess should not be permanent, etc.

Mehmet.


